# ClusterFinder Config File

HitStore MCHits #Either MCHits or Hits (accessed in ANNIEEvent store)
OutputFile Run1415S0_AllPMTs_ClusterFinder #Output root prefix name for the current run
# Before the time merge (PR #401): ClusterFindingWindow 50, ClusterIntegrationWindow 50. With those windows keep TimeMergeWindow 0; TimeMergeWindow 50 and TimeMergeMinTime 0 go with the 20 ns window.
ClusterFindingWindow 20 # in ns, size of the window used to "clusterize"
AcqTimeWindow 4000 # in ns, size of the acquisition window
ClusterIntegrationWindow 20 # in ns, all hits with +/- 1/2 of this window are considered in the cluster
MinHitsPerCluster 10 # group of hits are considered clusters above this amount of hits

verbosity 0         #verbosity of the application
end_of_window_time_cut 0.95 # from 0 to 1, length of the window you want to loop over with respect to acq. window (1 for full window, 0.95 for 95% from the start)
Plots2D 0 #2D charge-vs-time plot to be drawn?
TimeMergeWindow 50 # in ns, merge clusters whose median hit times are closer than this, chained in time order; 0 = off
TimeMergeMinTime 0 # in ns, clusters with an earlier median time are never merged; 0 = the whole window (e.g. 2000 leaves the prompt window alone)
